// title: Talk to a character
// about: Someone to meet, with a greeting and a few responses.
// kind: character
// order: 1
// step: Who
// question: name|Name|name||What players call this character.
// question: pronouns|Pronouns|choice:they,she,he,it|they
// question: place|Where do they live?|location||Choose a place, drag one here from the library, or make a new one.
// question: picture|Portrait (optional)|image?|
// step: Greeting
// question: greeting|What do they say first?|prose|Hello, stranger.|The player reads this when the talk starts.
// step: Responses
// question: responses|What can the player say?|responses|Ask about this place=There is much to discover.=back;Ask about them=Perhaps we will get to know each other.=back;Say goodbye==end|Each response has a reply. Then the talk goes back to the list, or ends.
== character {{id}}
name: {{name}}
pronouns: {{pronouns}}
lives at: {{place}}
image: {{picture}}
values:
    met: flag
talk:
    ~ {{id}}.met = true
    {{greeting}}
    {{responses}}
